    I want to fish some Salmon but my sister over here is such a nuissance. Something
    about the delicate balance of nature or whatever. I don''t care! I''m hungry!!","parentUIDs":[],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Rokko","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":0},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":2}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":37,"yPos":433},"ID":3,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
